Hi,<br><br>Without its mic, the MD-9600 is almost unusable.<br>P3 button is currently not used, except at boot time, but it's reserved for futur possible usage. So it won't be some random QuickKey assignment.<br>You can use Quickkey with P1(SK2) + &lt;number&gt;, or using the SK2 latch from the mic.<br>The longpress ENT as Orange is there because some users has defective Orange button.<br><blockquote class="uncited"><div>[*] Pushing this button would have the same effect as pressing SK2 + 1 (or any other number, but 1 or 0 seems logical), so I assume there's really not much to change in the code</div></blockquote>I assume you never looked at the code <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_e_smile.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":-)" title="Smile"><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sat Sep 28, 2024 3:54 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
